            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Okay, I just tried this:\n```\nmap <ScrollWheelDown> <Down>\nmap <ScrollWheelUp> <Up>\n```\nThis fixes my touchpad pixel scrolling issue, and works with `set mouse=a`, but it also means that when scrolling with the mouse, I only scroll by one line, whereas with `set mouse=` and no mapping I get pixel-smooth scrolling with the touchpad, and scroll-by-3 when scrolling with the mouse wheel.",
